{"4422360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Simulation Requires Supervision", "steam_appid": 4422360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation Requires Supervision</strong> (SRS) is a thought experiment on the decadence of human values. What could happen if we collectively overlook a few aspects of development? What if we sacrifice ourselves to evolve? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRS is a roughly 30 minutes long experience, where you have to manage your time remaining to explore the world of the game as much as you can, and reflect on it to make your final decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does <strong>not</strong> feature progress saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is meant to be played in a single sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Players Who Enjoy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven indie experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophical science fiction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow exploration and environmental storytelling</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation Requires Supervision</strong> (SRS) is a thought experiment on the decadence of human values. What could happen if we collectively overlook a few aspects of development? What if we sacrifice ourselves to evolve? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRS is a roughly 30 minutes long experience, where you have to manage your time remaining to explore the world of the game as much as you can, and reflect on it to make your final decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does <strong>not</strong> feature progress saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is meant to be played in a single sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Players Who 